a-controls=faq-0 aria-expanded=false class="flex items-center py-2 faq-toggle hover:underline justify-between text-left w-full" type=button><span class="font-medium text-sm leading-none md:text-base" itemprop=name>What is HasData?</span> <span class="flex items-center h-7 ml-6"><svg height=1em width=1em class="size-5 icon-open" data-icon=chevron-down><symbol id=ai:local:chevron-down viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6" stroke=currentColor stroke-linecap=round stroke-linejoin=round stroke-width=2 fill=none /></symbol><use href=#ai:local:chevron-down></use></svg> <svg height=1em width=1em class="hidden icon-close rotate-180 size-5" data-icon=chevron-down viewBox="0 0 24 24"><use href=#ai:local:chevron-down></use></svg></span></button></dt><dd class="hidden faq-answer mt-2 pr-12" id=faq-0 itemprop=acceptedAnswer itemscope itemtype=https://schema.org/Answer><p class=text-sm itemprop=text>HasData is a web scraping service for collecting structured JSON or Markdown from public websites. It offers 63 API endpoints and 21 available no-code scrapers, with prices starting at $0.08 per 1,000 requests. The cost depends on the endpoint and request settings.</p></dd></div><div class="border-t hd-divide-x -mx-4 px-4 py-4" itemprop=mainEntity itemscope itemtype=https://schema.org/Question><dt><button aria-controls=faq-1 aria-expanded=false class="flex items-center py-2 faq-toggle hover:underline justify-between text-left w-full" type=button><span class="font-medium text-sm leading-none md:text-base" itemprop=name>Can I use both no-code scrapers and APIs with one subscription?</span> <span class="flex items-center h-7 ml-6"><svg height=1em width=1em class="size-5 icon-open" data-icon=chevron-down viewBox="0 0 24 24"><use href=#ai:local:chevron-down></use></svg> <svg height=1em width=1em class="hidden icon-close rotate-180 size-5" data-icon=chevron-down viewBox="0 0 24 24"><use href=#ai:local:chevron-down></use></svg></span></button></dt><dd class="hidden faq-answer mt-2 pr-12" id=faq-1 itemprop=acceptedAnswer itemscope itemtype=https://schema.org/Answer><p class=text-sm itemprop=text>Yes, your subscription can be used flexibly across all our products. You can access no-code scrapers, scraping APIs, or a combination of both. No separate plans or subscriptions needed.</p></dd></div><div class="border-t hd-divide-x -mx-4 px-4 py-4" itemprop=mainEntity itemscope itemtype=https://schema.org/Question><dt><button aria-controls=faq-2 aria-expanded=false class="flex items-center py-2 faq-toggle hover:underline justify-between text-left w-full" type=button><span class="font-medium text-sm leading-none md:text-base" itemprop=name>Can I try HasData for free before subscribing?</span> <span class="flex items-center h-7 ml-6"><svg height=1em width=1em class="size-5 icon-open" data-icon=chevron-down viewBox="0 0 24 24"><use href=#ai:local:chevron-down></use></svg> <svg height=1em width=1em class="hidden icon-close rotate-180 size-5" data-icon=chevron-down viewBox="0 0 24 24"><use href=#ai:local:chevron-down></use></svg></span></button></dt><dd class="hidden faq-answer mt-2 pr-12" id=faq-2 itemprop=acceptedAnswer itemscope itemtype=https://schema.org/Answer><p class=text-sm itemprop=text>Yes, the free plan includes 1,000 credits every month. No credit card is required.</p></dd></div><div class="border-t hd-divide-x -mx-4 px-4 py-4" itemprop=mainEntity itemscope itemtype=https://schema.org/Question><dt><button aria-controls=faq-3 aria-expanded=false class="flex items-center py-2 faq-toggle hover:underline justify-between text-left w-full" type=button><span class="font-medium text-sm leading-none md:text-base" itemprop=name>Can I cancel or change my subscription at any time?</span> <span class="flex items-center h-7 ml-6"><svg height=1em width=1em class="size-5 icon-open" data-icon=chevron-down viewBox="0 0 24 24"><use href=#ai:local:chevron-down></use></svg> <svg height=1em width=1em class="hidden icon-close rotate-180 size-5" data-icon=chevron-down viewBox="0 0 24 24"><use href=#ai:local:chevron-down></use></svg></span></button></dt><dd class="hidden faq-answer mt-2 pr-12" id=faq-3 itemprop=acceptedAnswer itemscope itemtype=https://schema.org/Answer><p class=text-sm itemprop=text>Yes, you can upgrade, downgrade, or cancel your subscription at any time directly from your account dashboard. Changes take effect immediately.</p></dd></div><div class="border-t hd-divide-x -mx-4 px-4 py-4" itemprop=mainEntity itemscope itemtype=https://schema.org/Question><dt><button aria-controls=faq-4 aria-expanded=false class="flex items-center py-2 faq-toggle hover:underline justify-between text-left w-full" type=button><span class="font-medium text-sm leading-none md:text-base" itemprop=name>What is an API credit, and how are they used?</span> <span class="flex items-center h-7 ml-6"><svg height=1em width=1em class="size-5 icon-open" data-icon=chevron-down viewBox="0 0 24 24"><use href=#ai:local:chevron-down></use></svg> <svg height=1em width=1em class="hidden icon-close rotate-180 size-5" data-icon=chevron-down viewBox="0 0 24 24"><use href=#ai:local:chevron-down></use></svg></span></button></dt><dd class="hidden faq-answer mt-2 pr-12" id=faq-4 itemprop=acceptedAnswer itemscope itemtype=https://schema.org/Answer><p class=text-sm itemprop=text>An API credit is HasData&#39;s internal unit for measuring the computational cost of a scraping request. The number of credits used per row or request depends on the scraper, its settings, the complexity of the task, and the data source.</p></dd></div><div class="border-t hd-divide-x -mx-4 px-4 py-4" itemprop=mainEntity itemscope itemtype=https://schema.org/Question><dt><button aria-controls=faq-5 aria-expanded=false class="flex items-center py-2 faq-toggle hover:underline justify-between text-left w-full" type=button><span class="font-medium text-sm leading-none md:text-base" itemprop=name>What happens if my scraping request fails?</span> <span class="flex items-center h-7 ml-6"><svg height=1em width=1em class="size-5 icon-open" data-icon=chevron-down viewBox="0 0 24 24"><use href=#ai:local:chevron-down></use></svg> <svg height=1em width=1em class="hidden icon-close rotate-180 size-5" data-icon=chevron-down viewBox="0 0 24 24"><use href=#ai:local:chevron-down></use></svg></span></button></dt><dd class="hidden faq-answer mt-2 pr-12" id=faq-5 itemprop=acceptedAnswer itemscope itemtype=https://schema.org/Answer><p class=text-sm itemprop=text>If your scraping request fails, the credits used are automatically refunded. Some scraping APIs also include automatic retries, so the system can try again and complete the data extraction even if the first attempt runs into issues.</p></dd></div><div class="border-t hd-divide-x -mx-4 px-4 py-4" itemprop=mainEntity itemscope itemtype=https://schema.org/Question><dt><button aria-controls=faq-6 aria-expanded=false class="flex items-center py-2 faq-toggle hover:underline justify-between text-left w-full" type=button><span class="font-medium text-sm leading-none md:text-base" itemprop=name>What if I need more than my current subscription offers?</span> <span class="flex items-center h-7 ml-6"><svg height=1em width=1em class="size-5 icon-open" data-icon=chevron-down viewBox="0 0 24 24"><use href=#ai:local:chevron-down></use></svg> <svg height=1em width=1em class="hidden icon-close rotate-180 size-5" data-icon=chevron-down viewBox="0 0 24 24"><use href=#ai:local:chevron-down></use></svg></span></button></dt><dd class="hidden faq-answer mt-2 pr-12" id=faq-6 itemprop=acceptedAnswer itemscope itemtype=https://schema.org/Answer><p class=text-sm itemprop=text>If you need higher limits or a custom solution, contact our support team via live chat or email at info@hasdata.com. We&#39;ll work with you to find a flexible option that fits your needs.</p></dd></div><div class="border-t hd-divide-x -mx-4 px-4 py-4" itemprop=mainEntity itemscope itemtype=https://schema.org/Question><dt><button aria-controls=faq-7 aria-expanded=false class="flex items-center py-2 faq-toggle hover:underline justify-between text-left w-full" type=button><span class="font-medium text-sm leading-none md:text-base" itemprop=name>Do you provide custom scraping solutions?</span> <span class="flex items-center h-7 ml-6"><svg height=1em width=1em class="size-5 icon-open" data-icon=chevron-down viewBox="0 0 24 24"><use href=#ai:local:chevron-down></use></svg> <svg height=1em width=1em class="hidden icon-close rotate-180 size-5" data-icon=chevron-down viewBox="0 0 24 24"><use href=#ai:local:chevron-down></use></svg></span></button></dt><dd class="hidden faq-answer mt-2 pr-12" id=faq-7 itemprop=acceptedAnswer itemscope itemtype=https://schema.org/Answer><p class=text-sm itemprop=text>Yes, we will be happy to address your data collection requests, if you provide a specific website and the exact data points you need. We can&#39;t take on vague requests without clear sources and targets.</p></dd></div></dl></div></div></div></section><script type=module>function n(){document.querySelectorAll(".faq-toggle").forEach((e=>{e.addEventListener("click",(()=>{const t="true"===e.getAttribute("aria-expanded"),n=e?.closest("dt")?.nextElementSibling,i=e.querySelector(".icon-open"),o=e.querySelector(".icon-close");e.setAttribute("aria-expanded",String(!t)),n?.classList.toggle("hidden",t),i?.classList.toggle("hidden",!t),o?.classList.toggle("hidden",t)}))}))}n(),document.addEventListener("astro:after-swap",n)</script><section class=section><div class="relative overflow-hidden"><div class="border-t hd-divide-x"></div><div class="container gap-10 grid grid-cols-1 lg:gap-0 lg:grid-cols-2 py-[60px]"><div class="flex flex-col relative justify-center max-lg:items-center max-lg:text-center max-w-4xl mx-auto z-[2]"><h2 class="font-normal mb-3 text-5xl">Free to start, pay per success</h2><p class="mb-8 text-balance">1,000 API calls included. No credit card required.</p><a href=https://app.hasdata.com/sign-up class="font-medium w-fit flex bg-[#EEF3FB] ho